{"id":"5580","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5580_main_noctilucent-cloud_special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>本图为一些主要类型的夜光云：<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云纱</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">条带</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">涡旋</span>。天空晴朗，能见度良好，但也有一些低空对流云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alan C. Tough","location":"英国，苏格兰，埃尔金，霍普曼","latitude":"纬度: 57° 42' 38'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 25' 38'' W","date":"09 June 2013 0023 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10U.3"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5581_main_noctilucent-cloud_special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>通常只有在中-高纬度地区（约50°N-65°N或50°S-65°S），以及在夏季几个月的曙暮天空或夜空中，当中间层温度最冷时才能够看到夜光云（NLC）。本照片拍摄于6月末北半球的夏季，地点为55.78°N。</p>\n<p>通常在曙暮时分，太阳低于观测者水平线6°-16°时，可看到夜光云。在此时段，背景天空很暗，可以看到这种云，而高空云仍被阳光照得发亮。</p>\n<p>通常，夜光云与对流层云的视觉区别是其在夜间可见及其明显且有时明亮的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蓝-白色</span>。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>的低空对流层云处于地球阴影中，它们在相对更亮的背景天空中映衬出黑色的廓影。相反，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">夜光云始终比曙暮天空更明亮</span>。在地平线附近，它们可呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡红色</span>。照片中有两大类夜光云：<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">条带（II型）</span>- 这些是长条纹 – 和波浪（III型），在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">7</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">8</span>可见– 这些是密集、大致平行的条纹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Ewan Kane","location":"英国，苏格兰，东基尔布赖德","latitude":"纬度: 55° 46' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 4° 8' 48'' W","date":"23 June 2015 2247 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5879_main_noctilucent-cloud-type-1-veils_special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在本图的中上方有夜光云，它<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">稀薄且边界结构不够清晰。这是I型 – 云纱</span>。在左侧，有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">边缘弥散、模糊的IIa型条带</span>以及一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">边缘清晰的IIb型条带</span>。在图片的右上侧，为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">复合结构</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pekka Parviainen","location":"芬兰，图尔库","latitude":"纬度: 60° 27' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 22° 15' 60'' E","date":"21 July 2005 2146 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5691_main_noctilucent-cloud-type-iib-bands-with-sharply-defined-edges_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>本图中的主要夜光云类型是IIb型–边缘边界清晰的条带（在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>可见）。横跨本图中间的最亮条带似乎呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">扭曲或辫状</span>。</p>\n<p>就在图中间上方的短、直和窄条纹是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">IIIa型 – 波浪</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mark Zalcik","location":"加拿大，艾伯塔省，纳冒","latitude":"纬度: 53° 42' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 29' 32'' W","date":"28 June 2014 0243 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5690_main_noctilucent-cloud-type-iiib-billows-wave-like-structure-with-undulations_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>III型 – 波浪：密集排列、基本平行的短条纹。有两种类型：</p>\n<p>– IIIa型：由短、直和窄的条纹构成</p>\n<p>– IIIb型：显示有波纹的波状结构</p>\n<p>图中的波浪类型是IIIb型 – 有波纹的波状结构。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mark Zalcik","location":"加拿大，艾伯塔省，纳冒","latitude":"纬度: 53° 42' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 29' 32'' W","date":"09 July 2014 0031 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5795_main_noctilucent-cloud-type-ivc_special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>图中主要的夜光云类型为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">IVc型 – 涡旋：大尺度环状结构</span>。在左上侧，有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">IIIb型的弥散波浪</span>。在右上侧，则有一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">复合结构O型</span>。图中<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">前景中还有对流层云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pekka Parviainen","location":"芬兰，库斯塔维","latitude":"纬度: 60° 32' 42'' N","longitude":"经度: 21° 21' 19'' E","date":"10 August 1988 0043 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10"}]}]}